   "image": "foret/foret.jpg",
   "alt": "A sunny forest glade painted in ink and gouache. Along the back, four painted ways lead deeper into the woods: a wooden arch hung with birdhouses, an arch of flowers buzzing with bees, a carved arch with paw prints and a giant hollow tree, plus two little signposts, one carved with a swan and one with a wolf's head. In the glade: a fox sits in four rays of sunlight, a squirrel bounces on a branch like a diving board, another cracks a walnut on a stump, toy racing cars zoom along a track among twisting roots, a log burns in a ring of stones beside a Yule log cake on a stump, a boa coils on a fallen log, a fir tree oozes sap into a little pan, a throne is carved from a great tree trunk, a bison calf peeps out of a round bush, pine cones drop into a frying pan on a stove, and a lumberjack in a checked shirt chops a tree. The white gate at the bottom left leads out to the valley.",
